            <p class="ve-label ve-kicker">Accessible by design</p>
            <h2 class="ve-h2" id="accessTitle" data-split>Step-free, <em>where it matters.</em></h2>
            <p class="ve-lede" data-reveal="up">The bungalow was restored with accessibility as a priority, not an afterthought. Several chambers and every key shared space are step-free.</p>
          </div>
          <ul class="bh-access__list">
            <li><svg class="ve-ico"><use href="#x-check"/></svg>Founder&rsquo;s Suite, step-free</li>
